full-length dev pass with no LoRA. Runs on a Comfy Cloud GPU, billed by how long it runs at {'$'}0.001295/GPU-second (0.27 credits). Paid in credits, no Cloud subscription required.`,inputs:{prompt:{name:`prompt`},seed:{name:`seed`},aspect_ratio:{name:`aspect_ratio`},megapixels:{name:`megapixels`,tooltip:`Total pixel budget. 1.0 is about 1024x1024 at a square ratio.`},turbo:{name:`turbo`,tooltip:`Run the Turbo LoRA on a short schedule, trading a little fidelity for a much quicker run. Off runs the full dev pass with no LoRA.`},control_after_generate:{name:`control after generate`}},outputs:{0:{tooltip:null}}},K_n={display_name:`Comfy Cloud Mage Flow Text to Image [BETA]`,description:`BETA. The Comfy Cloud node set is still changing: options may be added or removed, and a workflow may be retired. Generates an image from a text prompt with Mage-Flow over a full 30-step pass. It takes a negative prompt, which the distilled turbo variant cannot use well. Runs on a Comfy Cloud GPU, billed by how long it runs at {'$'}0.001295/GPU-second (0.27 credits). Paid in credits, no Cloud subscription required.`,inputs:{prompt:{name:`prompt`},negative_prompt:{name:`negative_prompt`,tooltip:`Leave empty to keep the negative prompt this pipeline was tuned with.`},seed:{name:`seed`},aspect_ratio:{name:`aspect_ratio`},megapixels:{name:`megapixels`,tooltip:`Total pixel budget. 1.0 is about 1024x1024 at a square ratio.`},control_after_generate:{name:`control after generate`}},outputs:{0:{tooltip:null}}},q_n={display_name:`Comfy Cloud Mage Flow Turbo Text to Image [BETA]`,description:`BETA. The Comfy Cloud node set is still changing: options may be added or removed, and a workflow may be retired. Generates an image from a text prompt with distilled Mage-Flow in 4 steps at cfg 1. Roughly a seventh of the GPU time of the full pass, which makes it the one to iterate on. Runs on a Comfy Cloud GPU, billed by how long it runs at {'$'}0.001295/GPU-second (0.27 credits). Paid in credits, no Cloud subscription required.`,inputs:{prompt:{name:`prompt`},negative_prompt:{name:`negative_prompt`,tooltip:`Leave empty to keep the negative prompt this pipeline was tuned with.`},seed:{name:`seed`},aspect_ratio:{name:`aspect_ratio`},megapixels:{name:`megapixels`,tooltip:`Total pixel budget. 1.0 is about 1024x1024 at a square ratio.`},control_after_generate:{name:`control after generate`}},outputs:{0:{tooltip:null}}},J_n={display_name:`Comfy Cloud MiniMax H3 First-Last Frame to Video [BETA]`,description:`BETA. The Comfy Cloud node set is still changing: options may be added or removed, and a workflow may be retired. Generates the motion between two keyframes, with a matching soundtrack, using MiniMax H3. Give it the opening and closing frames and the model fills in the shot between them. The last frame is optional: leave it out and the motion runs away from the first frame instead. Runs on a Comfy Cloud GPU, billed by how long it runs at {'$'}0.001295/GPU-second (0.27 credits). Paid in credits, no Cloud subscription required.`,inputs:{first_frame:{name:`first_frame`},prompt:{name:`prompt`},seed:{name:`seed`},aspect_ratio:{name:`aspect_ratio`},resolution:{name:`resolution`,tooltip:`Frame size budget. 720p costs roughly twice the GPU-seconds of 480p.`},duration_seconds:{name:`duration_seconds`,tooltip:`Length in seconds. The pipeline quantises to 17-frame steps at 24fps, so the clip lands within about two thirds of a second of this.`},last_frame:{name:`last_frame`},control_after_generate:{name:`control after generate`}},outputs:{0:{tooltip:null}}},Y_n={display_name:`Comfy Cloud MiniMax H3 Image to Video [BETA]`,description:`BETA. The Comfy Cloud node set is still changing: options may be added or removed, and a workflow may be retired. Animates a still into a video with a matching soundtrack, using MiniMax H3. Feed it a clip's closing frame and it continues the sequence, so chaining several builds a longer shot. Runs on a Comfy Cloud GPU, billed by how long it runs at {'$